WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:22.440
Open Quick update on your phone.

2
00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:27.244
Press Change a price.

3
00:00:27.244 --> 00:00:32.221
Pick the price tag.

4
00:00:32.221 --> 00:00:35.152
The price now on the tag is here.

5
00:00:35.152 --> 00:00:38.375
Type the new price. Just the number.

6
00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:41.311
Press the button at the bottom.

7
00:00:41.311 --> 00:00:45.429
It is on your Pricing
page in 2 to 3 minutes.
